Package: vabaxos-tuning
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd-zram-generator (>= 1.1)
Description: VabaxOS system tuning: compressed memory before the disk
 When memory runs short, VabaxOS swaps to compressed memory (zram, half of
 the memory, at most 4 GB, zstd) before any swap partition, with the
 kernel settings advised for it, so the desktop and the screen reader do
 not freeze for seconds while the disk works.
